{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Preserve included JSON null values**\n\nThis treats an enabled value that is actually `null` exactly like disabled content. Consequently, a successful handler returning `null` omits `output` despite output inclusion defaulting to true, and legitimate null input is likewise lost. Track field presence separately from its value and emit JSON null when enabled/available; omit only disabled or unavailable content. Add null input/output wire-shape tests.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7obJ5R","finding_digest":"7222336e2d78db6abd6301708845ad1644039532304641747c6281929560f9e7","finding_id":"arf_v1_oirdg3rnpdnwvpldafyiqrnncz","finding_key":"insight-plugin/workflowinsight.java::applydatacontent::explicit-null-preservation","identity_key":"insight-plugin/workflowinsight.java::applydatacontent::explicit-null-preservation","line":349,"observation_digest":"9fcfd0e102df519802d6c9e8a9f3e13bb54e41c067173b08ed48144acefd4a58","observation_id":"aro_v1_t7h5byic35izqawwzhukt47bho","path":"insight-plugin/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/insight/WorkflowInsight.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_oirdg3rnpdnwvpldafyiqrnncz","published_at":"2026-08-31T23:44:10Z","review_id":"arr_v1_tayk6qge2h3e74wst5kjjjd6wi","reviewed_base_sha":"391d78894ba4e215c07a88dcc3ce20288f41d405","reviewed_head_sha":"24e28b812198c4b065174ba4b7f7600305deb4ae","reviewer":"codex","start_line":347,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":661},"record_id":"art_v1_2gbor2rlb2eiebsqxcncqt4e5x","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-08-31T23:44:10Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
